                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Colon</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-11-05"><hi rendition="#italic">November
                        5</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary of the Navy</hi>, <hi
